# EtIconV2

Single icon component: **Zappicons CDN**, **DS — React (Figma)** via registry, or **`renderIcon`** for inline SVG.

## Resolution order

1. **`renderIcon`** — e.g. `<EtIconV2 name="custom" renderIcon={({ size, color }) => <MySvg width={size} height={size} color={color} />} />` (name still used for a11y / theme).
2. Else **`name` in `DS_REACT_ICON_REGISTRY`** — bundled `react-native-svg` for that DS symbol.
3. Else **`name` is a DS — React symbol** (see `DS_REACT_ICON_GALLERY`) — fall back to **Zappicons CDN** (`name` + `variant`) when not bundled locally.
4. Else **Zappicons CDN** (`name` + `variant`).

[Figma DS — React](https://www.figma.com/design/cMyPhFndkPeXR6UkIuZujT/DS---React?node-id=37481-148641)

## Props

```tsx
<EtIconV2
  name="settings" // required
  variant={IconVariant.Regular}
  size="md" // xs(12) | sm(16) | md(20) | lg(24) | xl(32) | 2xl(48) | number
  color="#FF0000"
  onPress={() => {}}
  renderIcon={({ size, color }) => <MyIcon width={size} height={size} color={color} />}
/>
```

## CDN URL (non-DS names only)

```
https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/web-client/et-plus/zappicons/{name}/{variant}/{name}-{variant}.svg
```

Register DS SVGs in `libs/etoro-ui/src/components/et-icon-v2/ds-react/ds-react-icon-registry.ts`.

## Utilities (documentation only, don't use on client app)

```tsx
import {
  getOrFetchIconMetadata,
  getIconMetadata,
  getAllIconNames,
  getIconsByCategory,
  searchIcons,
} from 'etoro-ui/components/et-icon-v2';
```

## Limitations

- DS / `renderIcon`: single tint via `color` unless your SVG handles more.
- CDN: single tintColor.
- Static SVGs only (no animations).

## Design System Integration

`useIconTheme` resolves explicit icon color overrides and otherwise defaults every icon to `carbon900`.

| V1 token | V2 token | Used by case |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `textPrimaryNeutral` | `carbon900` | `default` |

## Behavior deltas vs production

Icons no longer apply name-based contextual default colors. Pass the `color` prop when an icon needs a brand, status, or warning color.
